      "@type": "FAQPage",
      mainEntity: [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the best protein powder for women?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "For most women, a whey isolate such as Dymatize ISO100 is the best all-rounder: about 25 g of protein for roughly 110-120 calories, low lactose and Informed Choice certification, per the brand. If you avoid dairy, Garden of Life Sport is a certified plant option. The best choice depends on your goal, budget and diet, not on a women's label."
          }
