          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Do women need a different protein powder than men?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "No. Protein is digested and used the same way regardless of sex. What differs is body size, muscle mass, training, calorie budget and life stage. A smaller woman may need a smaller total intake, and a single 20-25 g scoop is usually a complete dose. Women's formulas mostly change the marketing, the extras and the price."
          }
        },
