          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Will protein powder make women bulky?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "No. Building large amounts of muscle takes years of progressive, heavy training, a calorie surplus and, for most women, far more effort than a protein shake implies. Protein supports strength, recovery and the muscle you keep while losing fat. Most women who lift and eat enough protein end up looking leaner and more defined, not bulkier."
          }
